nk to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>a forum general topic unhidden in the chat</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.SUCCESSFUL_PAYMENT\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">SUCCESSFUL_PAYMENT</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'successful_payment'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.SUCCESSFUL_PAYMENT\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Successful payment</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.REFUNDED_PAYMENT\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">REFUNDED_PAYMENT</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'refunded_payment'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.REFUNDED_PAYMENT\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Refunded payment</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.CONTACT_REGISTERED\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CONTACT_REGISTERED</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'contact_registered'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.CONTACT_REGISTERED\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>A contact has registered with Telegram</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.SCREENSHOT_TAKEN\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span cla